---
---

<section id="faq" class="py-section bg-bg-2" aria-labelledby="faq-heading">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-[1fr_2fr] gap-20">
      <div class="pt-2">
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2.5 text-[0.72rem] font-bold tracking-[0.14em] uppercase text-accent mb-5 before:w-5 before:h-px before:bg-accent" data-i18n="faq.label">FAQ</div>
        <h2 class="section-title text-white text-[clamp(1.8rem,3.5vw,2.8rem)] font-extrabold tracking-tight leading-tight" id="faq-heading" data-i18n="faq.title">Good questions deserve straight answers.</h2>
        <p class="text-base text-gray-2 max-w-[520px] leading-relaxed mt-4" data-i18n="faq.sub">Still have something else? <a href="mailto:hello@emrg.studio" style="color:var(--accent-light);">Email us directly.</a></p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <div class="faq-list flex flex-col" id="faq-list">
          <div class="faq-item border-b border-border">
            <button class="faq-btn w-full flex items-center justify-between gap-4 py-[22px] bg-none border-none text-white text-[0.95rem] font-semibold text-left cursor-pointer transition-colors duration-300 tracking-tight hover:text-accent-light" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-ans-1">
              <span data-i18n="faq.q1">Can you really launch in 7 days?</span>
              <span class="faq-icon w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-bg-card border border-border flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 transition-all duration-300 text-gray-2 text-sm font-bold" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
            </button>
            <div class="faq-answer overflow-hidden transition-all duration-[400ms] max-h-0" id="faq-ans-1" role="region">
              <div class="pb-[22px] text-sm text-gray-2 leading-relaxed" data-i18n="faq.a1">Yes. Our Launch Sprint is scoped specifically for a 5–7 day delivery cycle.</div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="faq-item border-b border-border">
            <button class="faq-btn w-full flex items-center justify-between gap-4 py-[22px] bg-none border-none text-white text-[0.95rem] font-semibold text-left cursor-pointer transition-colors duration-300 tracking-tight hover:text-accent-light" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-ans-2">
              <span data-i18n="faq.q2">What do you need from us to get started?</span>
              <span class="faq-icon w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-bg-card border border-border flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 transition-all duration-300 text-gray-2 text-sm font-bold" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
            </button>
            <div class="faq-answer overflow-hidden transition-all duration-[400ms] max-h-0" id="faq-ans-2" role="region">
              <div class="pb-[22px] text-sm text-gray-2 leading-relaxed" data-i18n="faq.a2">For a store build: product information, existing brand assets (if any), copy, and Shopify/WooCommerce access.</div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="faq-item border-b border-border">
            <button class="faq-btn w-full flex items-center justify-between gap-4 py-[22px] bg-none border-none text-white text-[0.95rem] font-semibold text-left cursor-pointer transition-colors duration-300 tracking-tight hover:text-accent-light" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-ans-3">
              <span data-i18n="faq.q3">Do you handle packaging design?</span>
              <span class="faq-icon w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-bg-card border border-border flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 transition-all duration-300 text-gray-2 text-sm font-bold" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
            </button>
            <div class="faq-answer overflow-hidden transition-all duration-[400ms] max-h-0" id="faq-ans-3" role="region">
              <div class="pb-[22px] text-sm text-gray-2 leading-relaxed" data-i18n="faq.a3">Yes. Brand identity and packaging design are part of our Growth Sprint package.</div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="faq-item border-b border-border">
            <button class="faq-btn w-full flex items-center justify-between gap-4 py-[22px] bg-none border-none text-white text-[0.95rem] font-semibold text-left cursor-pointer transition-colors duration-300 tracking-tight hover:text-accent-light" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-ans-4">
              <span data-i18n="faq.q4">Do you support existing stores?</span>
              <span class="faq-icon w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-bg-card border border-border flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 transition-all duration-300 text-gray-2 text-sm font-bold" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
            </button>
            <div class="faq-answer overflow-hidden transition-all duration-[400ms] max-h-0" id="faq-ans-4" role="region">
              <div class="pb-[22px] text-sm text-gray-2 leading-relaxed" data-i18n="faq.a4">Absolutely. We work with established brands on CRO sprints, store rebuilds, flow optimization.</div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="faq-item border-b border-border">
            <button class="faq-btn w-full flex items-center justify-between gap-4 py-[22px] bg-none border-none text-white text-[0.95rem] font-semibold text-left cursor-pointer transition-colors duration-300 tracking-tight hover:text-accent-light" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-ans-5">
              <span data-i18n="faq.q5">What about SEO?</span>
              <span class="faq-icon w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-bg-card border border-border flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 transition-all duration-300 text-gray-2 text-sm font-bold" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
            </button>
            <div class="faq-answer overflow-hidden transition-all duration-[400ms] max-h-0" id="faq-ans-5" role="region">
              <div class="pb-[22px] text-sm text-gray-2 leading-relaxed" data-i18n="faq.a5">Every store we build includes SEO foundation — structured data, clean URL architecture, optimized meta tags.</div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="faq-item border-b border-border">
            <button class="faq-btn w-full flex items-center justify-between gap-4 py-[22px] bg-none border-none text-white text-[0.95rem] font-semibold text-left cursor-pointer transition-colors duration-300 tracking-tight hover:text-accent-light" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-ans-6">
              <span data-i18n="faq.q6">What happens after launch?</span>
              <span class="faq-icon w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-bg-card border border-border flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 transition-all duration-300 text-gray-2 text-sm font-bold" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
            </button>
            <div class="faq-answer overflow-hidden transition-all duration-[400ms] max-h-0" id="faq-ans-6" role="region">
              <div class="pb-[22px] text-sm text-gray-2 leading-relaxed" data-i18n="faq.a6">Growth Sprint includes 30 days of post-launch support.</div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="faq-item border-b border-border">
            <button class="faq-btn w-full flex items-center justify-between gap-4 py-[22px] bg-none border-none text-white text-[0.95rem] font-semibold text-left cursor-pointer transition-colors duration-300 tracking-tight hover:text-accent-light" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-ans-7">
              <span data-i18n="faq.q7">Do you manage paid ads?</span>
              <span class="faq-icon w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-bg-card border border-border flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 transition-all duration-300 text-gray-2 text-sm font-bold" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
            </button>
            <div class="faq-answer overflow-hidden transition-all duration-[400ms] max-h-0" id="faq-ans-7" role="region">
              <div class="pb-[22px] text-sm text-gray-2 leading-relaxed" data-i18n="faq.a7">We handle the infrastructure that makes ads perform — pixel setup, tracking, landing pages.</div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="faq-item border-b border-border">
            <button class="faq-btn w-full flex items-center justify-between gap-4 py-[22px] bg-none border-none text-white text-[0.95rem] font-semibold text-left cursor-pointer transition-colors duration-300 tracking-tight hover:text-accent-light" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-ans-8">
              <span data-i18n="faq.q8">How do revisions work?</span>
              <span class="faq-icon w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-bg-card border border-border flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 transition-all duration-300 text-gray-2 text-sm font-bold" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
            </button>
            <div class="faq-answer overflow-hidden transition-all duration-[400ms] max-h-0" id="faq-ans-8" role="region">
              <div class="pb-[22px] text-sm text-gray-2 leading-relaxed" data-i18n="faq.a8">All packages include defined revision rounds (2 for Launch Sprint, 3 for Growth Sprint).</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
